   "html": "<p>Hershey's operating margin was 25.9 percent in fiscal 2024.</p>\n<p>The peak before the cocoa shock. The gap between this and FY2025 is what the margin recovery case is about.</p>\n<p>Check: Copied from the Milestone 1 memo. Not yet checked against the source; check it there, then set status to confirmed. If the source does not print this percentage directly, change tier to D and write the formula here.</p>\n<h3>Related</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/FY2025%20operating%20margin%2012.3%20percent\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/FY2025 operating margin 12.3 percent\">FY2025 operating margin 12.3 percent</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=02%20Atomic%20Notes/FY2023%20operating%20margin%2022.9%20percent\" data-note=\"02 Atomic Notes/FY2023 operating margin 22.9 percent\">FY2023 operating margin 22.9 percent</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#note=01%20Sources/S1%20Hershey%20Form%2010-K%20FY2025\" data-note=\"01 Sources/S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025\">S1 Hershey Form 10-K FY2025</a></li>\n</ul>",
