   "html": "<p>One sentence stating the fact with the exact figure, period, and unit.</p>\n<p>Two to four sentences on why it matters for the valuation: which section it supports, what it implies, what would change if it were wrong.</p>\n<h3>Related</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[[]]</li>\n</ul>",
